Results
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
In the symmetric treatment,
 12/47 pass GARP.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
In the asymmetric treatment,
 4/46 pass GARP.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Roughly 17% pass GARP.
 
\end_layout

