\begin_layout Section
Afriat's Cost-Efficiency Index
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Suppose a dataset 
\begin_inset Formula $O$
\end_inset

 cannot be rationalized by any 
\begin_inset Formula $u$
\end_inset

 (GARP/SARP fails).
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
