\begin_inset Formula $\Delta(Z)$
\end_inset

 satisfies the independence axiom and weak-star continuity if and only if there exists a 
\begin_inset Formula $u:Z\to\mathbb{R}$
\end_inset

 bounded and continuous such that 
\begin_inset Formula $U(p)=\int u(z)dp(z)$
\end_inset

